==Bulgarian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{bg-IPA|сам}}
* {{rhymes|bg|am|s=1}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|bg|sla-pro|*samъ}}.

====Adjective====
{{bg-adj|сам|adv=са́мо}}

# [[alone]], by [[oneself]]
# the [[very]] ..., the ... [[himself]]/[[herself]]/[[itself]]
#: {{ux|bg|[[на]] '''сами́я''' [[край]]|at the '''very''' [[end]]}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''сама́та''' [[жена́]] [[дойда|дойде́]]|the [[woman]] '''herself''' [[come|came]]}}

=====Declension=====
