===Etymology 2===
{{inh+|bg|cu|сѣмъ}}, an oblique case form of {{m|cu|сѣмо|t=here, hither}}, from {{inh|bg|sla-pro|*sěmo}}. The unexpected vowel in modern [[Bulgarian]] is likely by analogy with {{m|bg|там|t=there}} and its derived terms.

====Adverb====
{{bg-adv|сам|-}} {{tlb|bg|archaic|or|dialectal}}

# {{n-g|with beckoning verbs in the [[imperative]]}}: [[here]], [[in]] [[this]] [[place]]
#: {{uxi|bg|Ела́ '''сам'''!|Come '''here'''!}}

